{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19014","headline":"途次大梁雪中奉天平令狐相公书问兼示新什因思曩岁从此拜辞形於短篇以申仰谢 · 刘禹锡","name":"途次大梁雪中奉天平令狐相公书问兼示新什因思曩岁从此拜辞形於短篇以申仰谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远守宦情薄，故人书信来。\n共曾花下别，今独雪中回。\n纸尾得新什，眉头还暂开。\n此时同鴈鹜，池上一徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}